                                        <h3>What is a healthy Mumbai D2C brand CAC?</h3>
                                        <p>Category-dependent: ₹300-800 F&B, ₹350-1,500 beauty, ₹350-1,200 fashion, ₹800-4,500 jewelry. LTV should be 3-5x CAC for sustainable scaling.</p>
